  "description": "Can you still remember elementary school questions?\n\n“I must have learned this before.”\n“I kind of remember it.”\nBut even problems we think we know can be surprisingly hard,\nor things we’ve simply forgotten over time.\n\nThis game is a knowledge check quiz based on what you learn in elementary school.\n\nJapanese, math, science, and social studies.\nFrom basic problems taught at school to questions that make you think, nostalgic elementary school questions appear in quiz form.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Read the question  \n・Choose an answer by intuition  \n・Understand instantly with results and explanations  \n\nEven when you answer correctly, there’s still something to learn.\nEven when you get it wrong, you’ll discover something new.\n\nPlay from just one question at a time.\nPerfect for passing time or checking knowledge with your family.\n\nWhy not take on these nostalgic elementary school questions\ntogether with your family?\n\nーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー\nTT supports game streaming by content creators.\nBoth individuals and companies are free to stream this game,\nand no permission from TT is required.",
